package account_deletion

// EnTextは英語版の退会完了メール (テキスト形式) です
templ EnText(isStripeSupporter bool) {
	We have received your request to delete your Annict account.

	The data associated with your account will be deleted shortly. Deleted accounts and data cannot be restored.

	if isStripeSupporter {
		Your supporter subscription will be canceled immediately. The remaining period will not be refunded.
	}

	You can sign up again as a new account with the same username and email address.

	Thank you for using Annict.

	If you did not request this, someone else may have used your account. Please review the password for your email account, and if you used your Annict password on other services, change it there as well. Then let us know at hello@annict.com so that we can investigate.
}
